235
00:22:50,470 --> 00:22:54,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Ataque especial: Dodonpa!</i></font>

236
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:56,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Cuidado, Goku-san!</i></font>

237
00:22:56,810 --> 00:22:59,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Venha! Vou deter isso com as mãos!</font>

238
00:22:59,180 --> 00:23:01,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Dodonpa!</i></font>

